"{\"reflection\": \"The consistent strategy of bidding at the true value of $100.00 has successfully secured profitable trades when asks were present, particularly in the final hours where market prices converged toward the true value. This approach maximizes profit margins while maintaining credibility in the market.\", \"plan_for_this_hour\": \"Place a bid at $100.00 to align with the true value and signal maximum willingness to pay. Since both queues are empty, this ensures readiness for any last-minute asks while maintaining profitability. No lower bids are justified, as they would reduce potential profit.\", \"bid\": 100.0, \"new_memory\": \"In Hour #20, a bid of $100.00 was placed with both bid and ask queues empty, continuing the strategy to signal maximum willingness to pay and prepare for potential final trades.\", \"scratch_pad_update\": \"#### Observations: Both bid and ask queues remain empty, with no active orders to match. #### Thoughts: Bidding at the true value of $100.00 reinforces commitment to fair pricing and ensures readiness for any last-minute sellers. This maintains market presence and aligns with profitability goals. #### Updated Strategy: Continue placing bids at $100.00 in the final hour to secure trades at the true value if any asks appear, or to signal maximum value if no trades occur.\"}"  									
